00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:47.416
There are eight hard and
fast rules that you have to

00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:50.136
follow religiously during Whole30.

00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:52.396
If you break one of
these rules and slip up,

00:00:52.396 --> 00:00:54.186
you have to restart the 30 day cycle,

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:56.896
because as the founders
describe in their book,

00:00:56.896 --> 00:00:59.996
it's not just the reset
