00:00:59.996 --> 00:01:02.706
It's an elimination diet
and if you reintroduce

00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:04.456
one of the foods in prematurely,

00:01:04.456 --> 00:01:06.406
that's gonna skew the results
and you won't learn as

00:01:06.406 --> 00:01:07.826
much from the 30-day period.

00:01:07.826 --> 00:01:09.982
Don't consume any added
sugars or sweeteners,

00:01:09.982 --> 00:01:12.586
artificial or otherwise.

00:01:12.586 --> 00:01:15.156
Do not consumer alcohol in any form.

00:01:15.156 --> 00:01:16.376
Do not eat grains.

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:19.105
This includes wheat,
rye, barley, oats, corn,

00:01:19.105 --> 00:01:21.406
rice, quinoa, and buckwheat.

00:01:21.406 --> 00:01:22.956
Do not eat legumes.

00:01:22.956 --> 00:01:24.886
This includes beans of all kinds,

00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:27.556
peas, chickpeas, lentils, and peanuts.

00:01:27.556 --> 00:01:29.646
