00:01:41.156 --> 00:01:43.606
The only exceptions are
clarified butter or ghee.

00:01:43.606 --> 00:01:47.346
No consumption of
carrageenans, sulfites, or MSG.

00:01:47.346 --> 00:01:50.523
Do not try and recreate baked
goods, treats, or junk foods

00:01:50.523 --> 00:01:52.326
with approved ingredients.

00:01:52.326 --> 00:01:55.105
You can't weigh yourself or
