00:04:46.236 --> 00:04:48.626
Here's my first and main
concern with Whole30,

00:04:48.626 --> 00:04:51.247
I think it puts an over-emphasis
on anecdotal evidence

00:04:51.247 --> 00:04:53.349
of people who've had
tremendous success with

00:04:53.349 --> 00:04:55.096
the Whole30 platform.

00:04:55.096 --> 00:04:57.246
The next 30 days will change your life.

00:04:57.246 --> 00:04:59.056
They will change the way
you think about food, they

00:04:59.056 --> 00:05:01.176
will change your taste, it
will change your habits and

00:05:01.176 --> 00:05:02.196
your cravings,

00:05:02.196 --> 00:05:04.970
it will restore healthy
emotional relationships with food

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.576
and with your body,

00:05:06.576 --> 00:05:08.724
the physical benefits
of Whole30 are profound,

00:05:08.724 --> 00:05:12.126
a full 96% of participants
